- Moreira et al., "A tutorial on synthetic aperture radar" [@moreira2013]: how the synthetic aperture forms an image, and what interferometry adds.
- The NASA SAR handbook [@flores2019]: hands-on chapters on flood mapping and change detection.
- Oliver and Quegan, *Understanding Synthetic Aperture Radar Images* [@oliver2004]: speckle statistics in depth.
- Gupta et al. on xBD [@gupta2019] and Chen et al. on BRIGHT [@chen2025]: the damage datasets and their baselines.
